# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets. This service holds DATABASE_URL, API_TOKEN, and the AI provider
# key. Nothing here is browser-visible and nothing here is committed.
.env*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.sw?

# AI cassettes recorded from REAL profile or CV text are local artifacts, never
# committed. Redacting a name is not sanitizing a document: the prompt still
# carries employers, schools, rates, and the user's own profile copy, and git
# history is permanent.
#
# Only cassettes recorded from SYNTHETIC input are tracked, negated by exact
# filename below. If you record a new committable fixture, use synthetic input
# and add it here explicitly.
src/ai/__cassettes__/*.json
!src/ai/__cassettes__/profileAnalyzer-5ec116efcad23d4a6a902cd6086149345efc0e8c5b3d2294ce6a5f5701c45209-v0.json
